{"title":"The Max Level Hero has Returned!","synopsis":"Pangeran lemah dari sebuah negara kecil Davey.&#x20;\n\nSetelah dalam keadaan koma jiwanya pergi ke sebuah kuil di mana para jiwa pahlawan berkumpul.\n\nDia berlatih selama ribuan tahun dan sekarang telah kembali sebagai pahlawan level tertinggi&#x20;\n\nTunggu saja aku akan menghadapi kalian secara langsung Cerita tentang kehidupan.\n\nDavey sebagai bangsawan dan pembalasan dendamnya telah dimulai!!","alternative_title":"만렙 영웅님께서 귀환하신다!, The Max Level Hero Strikes Back","author":"Devil's Tail","artist":"Yudo","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"chapters":[{"id":"8e01be44-4f03-4fa8-b84b-29491a2bc4ee","number":"242","title":"Chapter 242","date":"2026-07-28","images":[]},{"id":"47b3d1e0-6d01-4406-abaa-c6939a585cf5","number":"241","title":"Chapter 241","date":"2026-07-20","images":[]},{"id":"a8b86fa9-b947-4547-b5e4-8ed044a78231","number":"240","title":"Chapter 240","date":"2026-07-13","images":[]},{"id":"0e9cb99a-982a-4ae3-b60d-cd7eba530d12","number":"239","title":"Chapter 239","date":"2026-06-30","images":[]},{"id":"6a95ef05-9fe9-4e19-845c-bf7b2af99e4b","number":"238","title":"Chapter 238","date":"2026-06-24","images":[]},{"id":"d6b8d8ef-1e4c-4f38-bb10-a6bea876cde0","number":"237","title":"Chapter 237","date":"2026-06-16","images":[]},{"id":"28bf2154-d533-4f11-aa4f-19ab7cad6a94","number":"236","title":"Chapter 236","date":"2026-06-08","images":[]},{"id":"de33d189-0f26-46aa-9493-67e8df395dae","number":"235","title":"Chapter 235","date":"2026-05-26","images":[]},{"id":"1f1b7617-125e-4801-8229-9e288da29285","number":"234","title":"Chapter 234","date":"2026-05-11","images":[]},{"id":"ad81c439-0e3a-492b-84b5-ec935601b984","number":"233","title":"Chapter 233","date":"2026-05-04","images":[]},{"id":"7e1912fe-98e7-4b77-8ff8-c7afcb3bca1a","number":"232","title":"Chapter 232","date":"2026-04-27","images":[]},{"id":"c3a133a1-101f-4ab2-95c2-5404c0750d02","number":"231","title":"Chapter 231","date":"2026-04-20